I've published detailed notes and an annotated transcript to accompany the video of the keynote I gave at 
@WeAreDevs
 World Congress North America in San Jose on Friday - here's my rundown of everything that's happened with LLMs and agents in 2026 so far

Build for the agentic era. 

The future of how we build is being redefined, and it's exciting. I haven't seen much innovation in this space, but Base Code (from 
@Base44
), with its focus on cloud and collaborative tooling, makes a lot of sense. And it's model-agnostic too.
